        <details class="tool-faq-item">
            <summary>How do WiFi QR codes work on iPhone and Android?</summary>
            <p>When the payload follows the <code>WIFI:T:...;S:...;P:...;;</code> format, native camera apps detect it and offer to join the network. Users confirm before connecting.</p>
