        <details class="tool-faq-item">
            <summary>Can I change the destination after printing?</summary>
            <p>Static QR codes encode the URL directly — changing the destination requires generating a new code unless you point to a URL you control that redirects elsewhere.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="tool-faq-item">
            <summary>Why will my QR code not scan?</summary>
            <p>Common causes: insufficient contrast, missing quiet zone, blur from low-resolution PNG, inverted colors, damaged print, or payload too dense for physical size. Reprint larger with higher error correction and retest.</p>
